        closings: ("The aisle camera shows {D} put cans of infant formula into a coat after standing in the aisle for several minutes, and after {PRIOR} {DL} knew exactly what that means.", "Need is not a defense in every case, but the State must prove intent to steal, and {D} was feeding a baby."),
        timeline: [(0, "{DL} enters."), (0, "{DL} leaves.")],
        identified: "Aisle Camera",
        mood: .sympathetic)

