        openings: ("A school resource officer walking past {D}'s car at the edge of the lot during a football game smelled marijuana and found it inside the car, and this was not {DL}'s first time here, after {PRIOR} in {PRIORDATE}.", "The defense will say a friend left the marijuana in the car after riding with {D}, and {D} did not know it was there. {D} never smoked or sold any."),
