        allocution: "\"I sold that ring because I was behind on rent, and I believed I had the family's permission to borrow against it. I can see now that I should have asked more clearly and kept it in writing. I'm sorry to the homeowner who trusted me with the house. I'll make it right however the court directs.\"",
