        defendant: [.direct("Where did you get the e-bike?", "\"I bought it from a man at a flea market who said it was a spare he no longer needed.\""), .direct("What did you pay?", "\"Two hundred and fifty dollars. I knew it was a bargain, but I thought the seller just needed cash.\""), .direct("Did you know it was stolen?", "\"I didn't, at the time. When I saw the cut cable in the basket I should have wondered, but I wanted the bike.\""), .direct("Why did you list it online?", "\"I decided I didn't need it, and I wanted to make a little money. I never thought it could be traced.\""), .direct("What happened when the buyer came?", "\"I showed the bike to a person at the parking lot, and a deputy stepped out and asked about it.\""), .direct("What would you tell the owner?", "\"I'm sorry you lost your bike. I'll give it back and pay any repair costs for the scratch.\""), .cross("You've dealt in stolen goods before, haven't you?", "\"Yes, and I know I should have asked more questions. I made the same mistake again.\""), .cross("You saw a cut cable and kept the bike?", "\"I did, and I should have called the sheriff's office right then.\""), .cross("You sold it for double what you paid?", "\"I priced it high, and I see how that makes it look like I knew it was worth more.\""), .cross("The seller has a name?", "\"I know him only as a first name, and I'll give the deputy everything I remember.\""), .cross("You'll avoid buying from strangers?", "\"Yes, and I'll only buy with a receipt from now on.\"")],
